- [todo] For each sign separately, compute same-sign crossing predecessors with CDQ over the index-ordered list: in each merge, sweep left intervals by r and right queries by r, using a segment tree for range-max update on (l_i, r_i) and point query at l_j; repeat on reversed coordinates (N - 1 - r, N - 1 - l) to cover the other crossing direction, updating bad[j] with the maximum left index found.
